msgctxt "92"
msgid "Any idea which hospital the sixth chairman is in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"If everyone knew that, rival families would use it as an opportunity to try "
"and take him out. That's why no one but his boys know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Then, how do we know if he's even still alive? Maybe they're tryna cover up "
"the fact that he died right after he was shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I guess it's possible... If he croaks, there's a pretty good chance we're "
"gonna have a war of succession on our hands. They're probably lookin' to "
"avoid that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I'm sure he's just recovering at some fancy hospital somewhere in the "
"city... But whatever the case, take my advice, and quit sticking your nose "
"where it don't belong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Yeah, okay..."
msgstr "Sì, ok."

